      "id": "github:195297119",
      "name": "Open Hospital",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "Open Hospital 是开源医院信息管理软件（HIMS），覆盖患者登记、门诊与住院管理、药房与实验室、计费支持等医院运营流程；计费条目需手工录入，未与临床模块自动联动，账单为患者级。本仓库为便携包组装仓库，采用 GPL-3.0；OH CORE/GUI/API/UI 组件位于独立仓库，许可证未逐仓留档。",
      "homepage": "https://www.open-hospital.org",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/informatici/openhospital",
      "github_repository_id": 195297119,
      "license": "GPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/informatici/openhospital/license",
